  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "All high-transfer experimental analogues show oral bioavailability at or above 20%, with most in the 46-100% range. The query's piperazine, heteroaromatic, and amide features align with these high-bioavailability compounds, so the prediction is high.",
